The words is a list of "abcd", "cdab", "cbad", "xyzz", "zzxy", and "zzyx".
The signatures is an empty list of text.
The groups is 0.
For each word in words.
The last is the last position of word.
The evenletters is empty text, while the oddletters is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The piece is the slice of word from spot to spot plus 1.
If spot modulo 2 is 0, Place piece into evenletters.
If spot modulo 2 is 1, Place piece into oddletters.
The sortedeven is sort characters of evenletters.
The sortedodd is sort characters of oddletters.
The signature is empty text.
Place sortedeven into signature.
Place "|" into signature.
Place sortedodd into signature.
The known is 0.
For each saved in signatures, if saved matches signature, set known to 1.
If spot is last and known is 0, Place signature into signatures, add 1 to groups.

Show groups.
